CockroachDB plugin guidance and Toolbox configuration

Portions of the bundled skills and Toolbox configuration are adapted from the CockroachDB plugin project by Cockroach Labs.

Original project: CockroachDB plugin project by Cockroach Labs
Manifest version reviewed: 0.1.9

Modified for Cline's plugin model with a read-only local Toolbox MCP registration, consolidated Cline skills, and Cline-specific safety guidance. The managed CockroachDB Cloud MCP server is intentionally not registered because it requires user-specific headers, and source hook scripts are represented as Cline safety guidance instead of automatic script execution.

